    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fantasy world where you will become an adventurer, exploring vast maps, communicating with various NPCs, accepting missions, unlocking storylines, and gradually uncovering the secrets of this world. In this process, you will continuously accumulate wealth, acquire various weapons and props, and become increasingly powerful. This world may seem calm, but in reality, it is full of dangers and hidden currents. You need to challenge stronger enemies time and time again to resolve each crisis.</p>",
